description.narrative:
The CAPE Pilot has three core objectives:
1. Primary: To demonstrate how commercial business cases for investing in NBS can be realised by getting at least one project to financial close;
2. To develop the collective understanding of how to enable high-integrity projects to come to market, drawing on CAPE’s direct experiences and exchanging learnings with investors and other market actors;
3. To develop follow-on phases for CAPE, drawing on lessons from the pilot and raising finance for scale-up.
